Pieter, RouteWise confirmed the 9.2 upgrade for 24-25 Oct. I drafted a test p=
lan with 40 test cases, see attachment. Cases 1-25 are planner functions (ten=
dering, rate calculation, multi-stop, carrier assignment), 26-35 are reports =
incl. CO2, and 36-40 are the interfaces. Could you take the interface cases 3=
6-40 and check that the booking bot still works against API v2? I will do the=
 rest from 5 Oct when QA is upgraded. Target: first full run done by 7 Oct.

Kind regards,
Tom Hendriks
Transport planner
Corp Europe B.V. | Rotterdam
T +31 10 238 5986

